  m_text: 'Upgrades: <color=#5AD9FF>Magnet</color>, <color=#5AD9FF>Bubble</color>,
    <color=#5AD9FF>Smoke Bomb</color>, <color=#5AD9FF>Head Start</color>. Trails
    for your runner. Open the <color=#FFD65A>JUKEBOX</color> to buy tracks and pick
    the music you run to - your pick plays in every level.'
