  m_text: <color=#5AD9FF>Shield</color> soaks up hits first. When it's gone, <color=#5AD9FF>Vibe</color>
    drops. <color=#FF6B5A>Game over</color> when Vibe hits 0, the guard catches you,
    or you fall off a roof. The Game Over screen names what got you.
